# Soul Burn X=3 at Devoted Hero (1/2). The pool is {B}{B}{B}{B}{B}{W} (Black Lotus, Mox Jet, Gleemox chosen black, Mox
# Pearl) for {3}{2}{B}: X's part takes black or red, and only black is there, so the pool pays it one way - three black on
# X, the {B}, and a black and the white on {2}. 3 damage is dealt and 3 black was spent on X, but no more than the
# creature's toughness, 2, is gained, so Bot1 goes from 20 to 22, not 23. The Hero dies to the damage (CR 704.5g), so the
# cap was read before it.
